{{Quote|A katana made of fiery metals, forged by demons.|Item}}
'''Rengoku''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Rengoku is considered as one of the strongest swords in the [[Second Sea]], due to its simple obtainment and ability to stun [[Blade]] users, a very rare trait among swords.

Rengoku could be considered the [[Second Sea]] counterpart to [[Bisento]], as both possess high damage and very strong combos.

==Obtainment==
Rengoku can be obtained by using the [[Hidden Key]] to unlock a chest at the [[Ice Castle]], located in the [[Second Sea]]. The chest is hidden under the staircase, right below the [[Awakened Ice Admiral]], the entrance of which can be found to the right.

The "Samurai" [[Titles|title]] #131 will be granted upon equipping Rengoku.

